<title>RUSSIA: Central bank dollar/rouble rates 5464/5476.</title>
<headline>Central bank dollar/rouble rates 5464/5476.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Russian Central Bank said it had set 5464/5476 roubles per dollar as its bid and offer rates for its operations on the currency market on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The official rate for Thursday will be 5470.</p>
<p>On Tuesday the bid/offer rates were 5449/5473, with the official dollar rate 5461 from Wednesday.</p>
<p>The Central Bank announces daily bid/offer dollar/rouble rates for its currency operations. The midpoint of these rates is the official dollar/rouble rate for the following day.</p>
<p>The daily corridor for the rouble on the interbank market is 5350/5950 after 5347/5947.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
